        <mxCell id="notification-1" value="&lt;div style='font-size:19px;font-weight:bold'&gt;상세 Text 게시&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:15px;color:#526178'&gt;결과·실패 항목·근거·파일 링크&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:15px;color:#526178'&gt;Voice 생성·대기를 기다리지 않음&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=rectangle;rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EAF2FF;strokeColor=#2563EB;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#172033;dashed=0;arcSize=14;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
