        <mxCell id="notification-3" value="&lt;div style='font-size:19px;font-weight:bold'&gt;짧은 Voice 요약&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:15px;color:#526178'&gt;Interaction Manager가 재생 직전 차례·epoch 검사&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:15px;color:#526178'&gt;중요한 실패·불확실성 생략 금지&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=rectangle;rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EAF2FF;strokeColor=#2563EB;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#172033;dashed=0;arcSize=14;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
